<title>USA: Intermedia names Robert Manning CFO.</title>
<headline>Intermedia names Robert Manning CFO.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla. 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intermedia Communications Inc said Tuesday its board of directors had appointed Robert Manning as the company's chief financial officer.  </p>
<p>Intermedia said Manning was executive vice president of DMX Inc, a cable programmer based in Los Angeles.</p>
<p>A spokesman for Intermedia said Manning was replacing Ronald Tolliver, who resigned from the company in May.</p>
<p>Intermedia provides telecommunications services in voice, data and video.</p>
</text>
